      "text_length": 1228,
      "native_jats_id": null,
      "preview": "With over 2,000 years of history in China, areas of apple implantation have expanded annually, and 65% of all apples in "
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "section": "1. Introduction",
      "paragraph_hash": "1847257d2c1e92a6cef8a9ab52005081c7f0a4f37e7bfd3110d92d622698fa1d",
      "text_length": 485,
      "native_jats_id": null,
